  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2006.07 Use of Supplemental Repair Plates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2006.07 Use of Supplemental Repair Plates. The supplemental repair plate shall be used to:\n\n(a) Transport a vehicle owned by the repairer from one location to the repairer business; or\n\n(b) Demonstrate a rebuilt or repaired vehicle to a customer.\n\nSource. #8966, eff 8-23-07 (from Saf-C 2006.05); ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16; ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2000.html"
